      "message": "feat(ui): drop a model file on the window to import it\n\nA single dropped stl/obj/step/stp queues the Model dialog's own\nImportFile command; a hint shows while a file hovers. Several files,\na wrong extension or a non-file path are refused by name and leave the\nproject unchanged.\n\nFixes #1450\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
